# Phase 5 - Project Development

## Development Process

1. Prepare the employee spreadsheet.
2. Open the ServiceNow instance.
3. Navigate to Import Sets.
4. Create a new Import Set.
5. Upload the spreadsheet.
6. Select the target table.
7. Create a Transform Map.
8. Configure field mappings.
9. Run the Transform Map.
10. Verify the imported records.

## Source-to-Target Mapping

| Source Field | Target Field |
|---|---|
| Employee ID | Employee ID |
| Employee Name | Employee Name |
| Email | Email |
| Department | Department |
| Location | Location |

## Result

The spreadsheet data is transformed and imported into the ServiceNow target table.
